WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
A silver Stillforce mark turns in the light.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.850
Control fills an arched portrait. Moving across the game covers switches the artwork to No Man’s Sky and Cyberpunk 2077.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.900
The library filter opens. Favourites changes the selection to Stardew Valley, then All games restores the full wall.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:17.850
The game covers scroll while the artwork stays in place. The final selection brings Warframe into the arch.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.000
The Stillforce closing title appears.
